    "description": "Individual Assignment: 20.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLC301 · Assessment 3/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment:</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14198 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLC301 · Đầu điểm 3/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment:</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14198 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">6 weeks</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Applied individual assignment / worksheet set<br><br>Applied individual inquiry task based on the selected RBL-integrated module. Students analyze a customs dossier or declaration-related case, identify errors or inconsistencies, evaluate documentary evidence, propose a corrective action, justify the decision in a short memo, and submit a brief reflection on compliance implications and professional responsibility.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1 assignment</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Units 3–6: HS classification, valuation, tariff/tax application, declaration logic, and short compliance reflection</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Students complete an individual applied task set requiring analysis, structured answers, and justified customs/logistics reasoning. AI use, if any, must be disclosed.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Students complete one applied inquiry task,<br>involving dossier analysis,<br>evidence-based error diagnosis,<br>corrective action justification, and short reflection.<br><br>Output IA/ Individual RBL Applied Memo:<br>+ case summary<br>+ identified error(s)<br>+ evidence used<br>+ corrective action proposed<br>+ justification<br>+ short reflection</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 55 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Group Assignment Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 55 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Group Assignment Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
