    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLC301 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLC301 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4706/detail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4706/detail</a></strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>FIATA - VLA - VLI</p><p>FIATA Diploma in Freight Forwarding – Customs Procedures (course manual)</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Law on Customs 2014 (Vietnam)</strong></p><p>National Assembly of Vietnam / Vietnam Customs</p><p>Official legal basis for customs administration and procedures. <a href=\"https://www.customs.gov.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.customs.gov.vn/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Law on Export and Import Duties 2016 (Vietnam)</strong></p><p>National Assembly of Vietnam / Vietnam Customs</p><p>Official legal basis for tariff and tax determination. <a href=\"https://www.customs.gov.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.customs.gov.vn/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Decree 08/2015/NĐ-CP as amended by Decree 59/2018/NĐ-CP</strong></p><p>Government of Vietnam</p><p>Detailed regulations on customs procedures, inspection, and supervision. <a href=\"https://www.customs.gov.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.customs.gov.vn/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Circular 38/2015/TT-BTC as amended by Circular 39/2018/TT-BTC</strong></p><p>Ministry of Finance (Vietnam)</p><p>Operational guidance for customs procedures, valuation, and tax administration. <a href=\"https://www.customs.gov.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.customs.gov.vn/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>What is the Harmonized System (HS)?</strong></p><p>World Customs Organization</p><p>Official overview of the HS. <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>HS Convention</strong></p><p>World Customs Organization</p><p>Official HS Convention reference. <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/instrument-and-tools/hs_convention.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/instrument-and-tools/hs_convention.aspx</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>HS Nomenclature 2022 Edition</strong></p><p>World Customs Organization</p><p>Official HS 2022 reference. <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/instrument-and-tools/hs-nomenclature-2022-edition.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/instrument-and-tools/hs-nomenclature-2022-edition.aspx</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>WTO Customs Valuation Gateway</strong></p><p>World Trade Organization</p><p>Official customs valuation reference. <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_e.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_e.htm</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994</strong></p><p>World Trade Organization</p><p>Official legal text for customs valuation. <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/20-val_01_e.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/20-val_01_e.htm</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Vietnam Customs Portal (English)</strong></p><p>Vietnam Customs</p><p>Official customs portal and updates. <a href=\"https://www.customs.gov.vn/index.jsp?ngon_ngu=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.customs.gov.vn/index.jsp?ngon_ngu=en</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>National and ASEAN Single Window</strong></p><p>Vietnam Customs</p><p>Official Vietnam Customs NSW/ASW reference. <a href=\"https://www.customs.gov.vn/index.jsp?aid=164685&cid=4209&pageId=2281\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.customs.gov.vn/index.jsp?aid=164685&amp;cid=4209&amp;pageId=2281</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ASEAN Single Window</strong></p><p>ASEAN Secretariat</p><p>Official ASEAN overview. <a href=\"https://asean.org/our-communities/economic-community/asean-single-window/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://asean.org/our-communities/economic-community/asean-single-window/</a></p></div>"
